## Overview

SMART-BUSSINESS is a web application aimed at sellers and small businesses, combining an AI seller assistant with AI-driven content (reel/video) generation. The project began from a Lovable-generated React + Vite + shadcn/ui starter template and has since been extended with real product functionality: an AI chat assistant, an AI reel generator, video preview, voice narration (with a fallback mechanism), and Progressive Web App support, backed by Supabase.

This README documents what is confirmed by the repository's structure and commit history. Implementation-level details that were not directly visible (exact AI provider/model, specific env variable names, exact database schema) are described at the level the available evidence supports, and are flagged accordingly rather than invented.

