## 🎯 Problem

Small sellers and first-time business owners typically lack the time, design skills, and technical resources to produce marketing content (such as product reels/videos with narration) or to get quick, reliable answers to day-to-day business questions.

## 💡 Solution

SMART-BUSSINESS gives sellers a single web platform where they can:

- Chat with an AI assistant for seller/business-related help
- Generate promotional reels/video content from their product information
- Preview the generated video before using it
- Get automatic voice narration on generated content, with a fallback mechanism if narration generation isn't available

