2. Add your Supabase project URL and anon key to your local `.env` file.
3. Review the contents of the `supabase/` directory in this repository for any functions, migrations, or configuration that need to be deployed to your project (exact contents not confirmed from this listing).
4. If Edge Functions exist under `supabase/`, deploy them using the Supabase CLI.
5. Configure authentication and storage in your Supabase project only if your inspection of `supabase/` confirms the app uses them.

